id: CTB-LXM-DEC-000011-adopt
kind: decision
decision: LXM-DEC-000011
action: adopt
outcome: Option B: raise the full test-suite floor to Node 22.22.2 or later and re-resolve the development tooling to its fixed versions; the production floor stays 22.13.0 with a runtime-only lane; host installs get a security floor declared in the technology lock
effect: LXM-REQ-000048
